{"seq":2,"slug":"penalty-ladder","title":"分级处罚：警告、限流与封店","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-governance-risk/violation-handling/penalty-ladder","wordCount":3877,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"分级处罚-警告-限流与封店\">分级处罚：警告、限流与封店</h1><p>一个卖家第一次上架时把「纯棉」写成了「100% 有机棉」，这与一个卖家反复上架假货，在治理上是不是同一件事？显然不是，但很多早期系统的处罚逻辑只能表达「违规」与「不违规」两态，于是这两种情况被同等对待：要么都发个警告（假货贩子毫无损失），要么都下架（误标的卖家蒙受重创）。分级处罚要建的就是中间那一段——<strong>让处罚的严重程度连续地跟上情节的严重程度</strong>，并且让重复违规的边际代价递增到足以改变行为。</p>\n<p>本文只讨论罚则本身：处罚的档位有哪些、什么情节对应什么档位、累进怎么写、限流为什么往往是比下架更常用的手段。判定流程本身的机制见<a href=\"violation-state-flow\">违规判定、下架与处罚流程</a>，处罚被推翻后的救济见<a href=\"3-appeal-mechanism\">商家申诉与复核机制</a>。本文假设流程已经给出了一个「违规事实 + 情节标注」的输入，只回答怎么把它映射成一个处罚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-处罚是一组可调旋钮-不是一个开关\">核心概念：处罚是一组可调旋钮，不是一个开关</h2><p>把处罚理解成「下架 / 不下架」是最限制想象力也最容易出问题的做法。真实的处罚空间是一组正交的旋钮，每个旋钮调节一个不同的维度，组合起来才构成一次完整的处罚决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[违规事实 + 情节标注] --&gt; B{严重级别}&#10;    B --&gt;|轻微/初犯| C[第一档: 警告 + 整改要求]&#10;    B --&gt;|一般| D[第二档: 限流/降权]&#10;    B --&gt;|较重| E[第三档: 下架 + 扣分]&#10;    B --&gt;|严重/累犯| F[第四档: 冻结店铺/封店]&#10;    B --&gt;|特殊| G[第五档: 扣款/没收保证金]&#10;    C --&gt; H[累进引擎&lt;br/&gt;看历史违规次数与时间衰减]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[处罚决定&lt;br/&gt;含档位/时长/生效范围]&#10;    I --&gt; J[执行]&#10;    J --&gt; K[申诉窗口]&#10;    K --&gt;|推翻| L[撤销 + 恢复]&#10;    K --&gt;|维持| M[生效并写入累进历史]\">graph TD\n    A[违规事实 + 情节标注] --&gt; B{严重级别}\n    B --&gt;|轻微/初犯| C[第一档: 警告 + 整改要求]\n    B --&gt;|一般| D[第二档: 限流/降权]\n    B --&gt;|较重| E[第三档: 下架 + 扣分]\n    B --&gt;|严重/累犯| F[第四档: 冻结店铺/封店]\n    B --&gt;|特殊| G[第五档: 扣款/没收保证金]\n    C --&gt; H[累进引擎&lt;br/&gt;看历史违规次数与时间衰减]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[处罚决定&lt;br/&gt;含档位/时长/生效范围]\n    I --&gt; J[执行]\n    J --&gt; K[申诉窗口]\n    K --&gt;|推翻| L[撤销 + 恢复]\n    K --&gt;|维持| M[生效并写入累进历史]</pre><p>这张图要表达的核心观点是：<strong>档位选择与累进计算是两件事</strong>。档位由本次违规的性质决定（客观上它有多严重），累进由卖家的历史决定（主观上他是不是惯犯）。把两者混在一起写——例如「第三次侵权直接封店」这一类硬编码规则——会在遇到边缘情况时无法解释：一个三年前有过一次轻微违规、此后毫无瑕疵的卖家，被一个硬编码的计数规则直接封店，这样的判定在任何复核面前都站不住。所以正确做法是档位与累进<strong>分别计算再合成</strong>，且累进必须带<strong>时间衰减</strong>。</p>\n<p>为什么限流值得被单独列为第二档？因为它恰好落在「不痛不痒」与「伤筋动骨」之间，是这个处罚空间里最重要的一个中间档。限流不改变商品的合法性（它还在，还能被搜到，还能被老客户找到并购买），只是降低它在自然流量里的曝光权重。这带来三个好处：误判的后果是缓和的（卖家损失一部分流量而不是全部生意）；它是可连续的（权重可以从 0.9 调到 0.3，处罚严重程度可以精细调节）；它不产生「下架-重新上架」这套会触发搜索索引重建的昂贵操作。代价是它的可感知性弱——卖家不一定立刻意识到自己被限流了，因此它的通知设计要比下架更明确，否则就会变成「平台在暗中压制我」这种最难处理的猜疑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>主要动作</th>\n<th>作用维度</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>对卖家的实际痛感</th>\n<th>误判容忍度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>警告</td>\n<td>通知 + 整改期限</td>\n<td>心理与流程</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高（可以宽松）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流/降权</td>\n<td>曝光权重下调（可设比例与时长）</td>\n<td>流量</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n<td>中（视比例而定）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下架</td>\n<td>商品不可售（可设时长）</td>\n<td>交易</td>\n<td>可逆但恢复慢（排名与销量受损）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扣分</td>\n<td>卖家健康分扣减</td>\n<td>资格与额度</td>\n<td>可通过考核恢复</td>\n<td>中–高（影响后续权限）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保证金扣款</td>\n<td>资金处罚</td>\n<td>资金</td>\n<td>难逆（需退款流程）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结店铺</td>\n<td>全店不可售，限期</td>\n<td>经营资格</td>\n<td>可逆但损失巨大</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封店</td>\n<td>永久终止</td>\n<td>经营资格</td>\n<td>不可逆</td>\n<td>毁灭性</td>\n<td>几乎为零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「误判容忍度」这一列是这张表的实用价值所在。它把「什么情况下可以自动化」的问题转化成了「这个档位能容忍多少误判」的问题，从而与<a href=\"violation-state-flow\">违规判定、下架与处罚流程</a>里的置信度门控对接：容忍度越低的档位，自动化所需的置信度越高，且越需要人工确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"情节评估-把定性判断变成可计算的量\">情节评估：把定性判断变成可计算的量</h2><p>档位选择需要一个统一的「情节严重程度」度量。一个可用的合成量把四个因素相乘或相加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>severity</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{severity} = w_h \\cdot H + w_i \\cdot I + w_s \\cdot S + w_r \\cdot R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">severity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中四个分量分别是：</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 危害性（harm）</strong>，反映违规行为本身对买家与生态的实际伤害。假货、食品药品安全、人身安全类问题的危害性天然高于描述不符与图片不规范。这一项应当由规则本身携带，而不是由判定人临时判断——每条规则在<a href=\"../compliance-patrol/cross-market-rule\">各市场合规规则差异治理</a>的规则包里就应当声明它的危害等级。</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 影响面（impact）</strong>，反映已经或可能受到影响的范围：商品的历史曝光与成交量、是否处于大促期间、涉及多少买家。这一项是动态的，需要从业务数据实时取。「一条卖出五千单的假货」与「一条无人问津的假货」在处置紧急度上完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 主观性（intent）</strong>，反映卖家是否明知故犯。这不是一个能直接观测的量，但可以用代理指标：卖家是否为规避检查做过明显的变形处理（把品牌名做成图片、用拼写变体、反复修改以避开巡检窗口）、是否在收到通知后立刻改回原样、店铺是否与该类违规存在历史关联。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是四个分量里最难量化的，也是最有争议的——治理上必须承认它的推断性质，因此它只应当在档位之间做<strong>有限度</strong>的调节，而不能单独把处罚从警告推到封店。</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 累进（recidivism）</strong>，反映历史违规的积累。它与其他三项的区别是它单独构成一个时间衰减函数，见下一节。</p>\n<p>四个分量的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 需要在实践中校准。校准的方法不是拍脑袋，而是用一个简单的自洽性检验：把历史上人工判定的案例拿出来，看这套公式的排序与人工判定的严重程度排序的相关系数。如果相关性低，说明某个分量的权重偏离了组织的实际判断标准。这个校验的价值在于它暴露分歧——如果公式与人工判断系统性不同，说明「组织实际在意什么」与「规则写的是什么」不一致，而这种不一致本身就是要修的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"累进机制与时间衰减\">累进机制与时间衰减</h2><p>累进的目的不是报复，而是让重复违规的成本超过其收益。这一点决定了累进的两个设计要点。</p>\n<p><strong>要点一：累进必须作用在「同类违规」上，而不是所有违规的总次数。</strong> 一个卖家因为描述不规范被警告过两次，与它因为售假被处罚过两次，是完全不同的信号。因此累进计数要按违规类别分组（通常按规则包里的类别字段分组，粒度不宜过细否则累进永远不触发，也不宜过粗否则会把无关违规叠加）。实践中一个可用的粒度是「危害域」级别：商品安全、知识产权、交易诚信、信息规范、履约服务。</p>\n<p><strong>要点二：累进必须有时间衰减，因为卖家的行为会改变。</strong> 一个永久累进的系统会在几年后把所有老卖家都变成高危对象。可用的形式是指数衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mi>τ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t) = \\sum\\_{k} \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{t - t_k}{\\tau}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次历史违规的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减时间常数（指数衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(t)=N_0 e^{-t/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.038em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的定义与时间常数的含义，来源：Exponential decay, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exponential_decay）。$\\tau$\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exponential_decay）。$\\tau$</a> 的取值决定了「改过自新」需要多久——常见的量级是几个月到一年。这个公式有一个直观的解读：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 的值近似等于「最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 时间内的等效违规次数」，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = 180</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span></span></span></span></span> 天、半年前有两次违规的卖家，其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.74</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\approx 2 \\cdot e^{-1} \\approx 0.74</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.74</span></span></span></span></span>，相当于不到一次违规的权重。这个解读让业务方容易接受这个参数，也容易在调参时讨论——「我们希望卖家整改多久后相当于清零」是一个业务问题，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是它的数学答案。</p>\n<p>累进的档位提升需要设上限和缓冲。<strong>上限</strong>是指同一类违规的累进最多提升两个档位（例如从警告到扣分，或从限流到下架），不允许因为累进直接从警告跳到封店——那样的跃迁会让「初犯从轻」的承诺失效。<strong>缓冲</strong>是指每次处罚生效后要有一个冷却期，在此期间新的轻微违规不再触发累进提升，因为大促或者平台规则变动期间，同一批卖家集中触发同一条规则的误判是常见现象，冷却期能避免把一次系统性问题放大成对个别卖家的连续打击。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>累进状态</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 区间</th>\n<th>档位调整</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>按基础档位</td>\n<td>无历史或历史已久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5 \\le R &lt; 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>上调一档</td>\n<td>近期有同类违规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\le R &lt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>上调一档 + 时长加倍</td>\n<td>明显重复行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惯犯</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>上限于两档提升，强制人工确认</td>\n<td>触发深度调查，见关联图谱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的意义在于：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 高到一定程度时，问题已经不是「这一次该罚多重」，而是「这个卖家是不是应该被系统性调查」。此时正确的动作不是自动加重处罚，而是把它送进深度调查流程——这正是<a href=\"../fraud-ring-detection/graph-risk-signal\">关联图谱风险信号</a>与<a href=\"../seller-risk-layer/seller-risk-score\">卖家风险分与分级管控</a>的输入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处罚时长的确定与自动升级\">处罚时长的确定与自动升级</h2><p>除了档位，时长是第二个可调旋钮。同是下架，三天与三十天是完全不同的处罚。时长的确定应当遵循「与整改所需时间匹配」的原则，而不是拍一个整齐的数字。</p>\n<p>具体来说，时长由三部分构成：<strong>整改时间</strong>（卖家修复问题需要多久，例如更换问题资质文件需要重新申请，那就不是一天能完成的）、<strong>复核等待时间</strong>（平台验证整改结果的排队时间）、以及<strong>惩戒附加时间</strong>（纯粹为了产生痛感而加的部分）。第一、二部分是可解释的、可以公示的；第三部分是不可解释的、但真实存在。成熟的做法是把前两部分明确写进通知（「请在 5 个工作日内提交新的资质文件，我们将在 3 个工作日内完成验证」），把第三部分表达为「最低处罚时长」，避免让卖家把处罚时长理解成一个可以精确计算的流程时间。</p>\n<p>自动升级（卖家在处罚窗口内不整改、不申诉、商品继续违规）需要一条明确的路径。这里最容易出的错是<strong>沉默即默认</strong>：卖家没有响应，系统既不算他放弃也不继续升级，违规单就停在那里，商品也处于一个模糊状态。正确做法是给每个处罚窗口设一个明确的终局行为——到期未整改则升级到下一档，到期未申诉则按原判生效——并且这个终局由定时任务驱动，而不是靠人盯着。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处罚的可见性与通知策略\">处罚的可见性与通知策略</h2><p>处罚的效果取决于卖家是否感知到它。这里的工程问题不是「发不发通知」，而是<strong>通知的粒度与时机</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>限流类处罚必须显式告知。</strong> 因为限流本身不可见（商品还在、还能买到），如果不告知，卖家会把流量下降归因于算法变化、季节因素或者「平台在针对我」，并在社群中传播这种判断。告知的内容不需要给出精确的权重数值（那会立刻引来博弈），但要说清「哪个商品、因为什么问题、在什么时间段内、曝光会被降低」。</p>\n<p><strong>下架类处罚的通知要给卖家留出「快速纠错」的选项。</strong> 对于描述不符、图片不合规这类低危害问题，卖家自行的快速修复（改标题、换图）应当在合规后自动恢复，而不需要走完整的申诉流程。这条通道的存在能显著降低申诉量，因为它把「卖家觉得自己被冤枉」的情形变成了「卖家改一下就没事」的情形。</p>\n<p><strong>重处罚的通知需要一个更高层级的触点。</strong> 封店或大额扣款这类决定，仅靠系统通知是不够的：它需要后续的人工联系（面向有一定规模的卖家）或者至少是一个明确的多渠道送达确认。这里的判断标准是「这个决定会不会让卖家彻底离开平台」，如果会，那么一次静默的系统通知在事后一定会被指责为程序不公。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处罚档位</th>\n<th>通知渠道</th>\n<th>是否给出精确参数</th>\n<th>是否需人工触点</th>\n<th>快速纠错通道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>警告</td>\n<td>站内信 + 邮件</td>\n<td>是（整改要求明确）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>不需要（无实际损失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td>站内信 + 邮件（必须显式）</td>\n<td>给范围不给精确权重</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>整改后自动解除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下架</td>\n<td>站内信 + 邮件 + 应用内提示</td>\n<td>是（时长与原因）</td>\n<td>大规模卖家需要</td>\n<td>提供</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扣分</td>\n<td>站内信 + 邮件</td>\n<td>是（扣分项与恢复路径）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>通过考核恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结/封店</td>\n<td>多渠道 + 人工联系</td>\n<td>是（依据与申诉路径）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>仅申诉通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>处罚是一组正交旋钮而非开关，主要档位是警告、限流、下架、扣分、扣款、冻结、封店；各档的「误判容忍度」决定了它能被自动化到什么程度。</li>\n<li><strong>限流</strong>是最重要的中间档：可逆、可连续、不触发索引重建，代价是可见性弱，因此必须显式通知。</li>\n<li>情节评估用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>（危害）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>（影响面）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（主观性）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（累进）合成；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 只能做有限调节，不能单独把处罚推到封店。</li>\n<li>累进按<strong>危害域</strong>分组、带指数时间衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)=\\sum_k \\exp(-(t-t_k)/\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，档位提升上限于两档，并设冷却期避免系统性问题被放大。</li>\n<li>时长由整改时间 + 复核等待 + 惩戒附加构成；处罚窗口必须有明确的终局行为，不能停在沉默状态。</li>\n<li>累进达到惯犯区间时，正确动作是转入深度调查而非自动加重，接口通向<a href=\"../fraud-ring-detection/graph-risk-signal\">关联图谱风险信号</a>。</li>\n<li>流程与证据机制见<a href=\"violation-state-flow\">违规判定、下架与处罚流程</a>，处罚被推翻后的补救见<a href=\"3-appeal-mechanism\">商家申诉与复核机制</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分级处罚：警告、限流与封店","id":"分级处罚-警告-限流与封店"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：处罚是一组可调旋钮，不是一个开关","id":"核心概念-处罚是一组可调旋钮-不是一个开关"},{"level":2,"text":"情节评估：把定性判断变成可计算的量","id":"情节评估-把定性判断变成可计算的量"},{"level":2,"text":"累进机制与时间衰减","id":"累进机制与时间衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"处罚时长的确定与自动升级","id":"处罚时长的确定与自动升级"},{"level":2,"text":"处罚的可见性与通知策略","id":"处罚的可见性与通知策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"违规判定、下架与处罚流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-governance-risk/violation-handling/violation-state-flow"},"next":{"title":"商家申诉与复核机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-governance-risk/violation-handling/appeal-mechanism"}}